# QA-011: Coarse and fine burette steps produce different endpoint uncertainty
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.001035mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 HCl 0.001035mol
titrate v1 NaOH 0.1M 1mL until ph 7 max 30
titrate v2 NaOH 0.1M 0.1mL until ph 7 max 200
inspect
